lines:
I am the last of the Pokémon League
Elite Four, Drake the Dragon master!{be01}
In their natural state, Pokémon are
wild living things. They are free.{be01}
At times, they hinder us.
At times, they help us.{be01}
For us to battle with Pokémon as
partners, do you know what it takes?{be01}
Do you know what is needed?{be01}
If you don’t, then you will never
prevail over me!

身为宝可梦训练家，
你的确具备能走到这一步的能力。{be01}
看起来你知道获胜
所需的条件是什么。{be01}
没错。训练家需要的
正是一颗善良的心。{be01}
宝可梦感受到训练家的善心
才会学着分辨对错，{be01}
感受到训练家的善心
才会变得更加强大。{be01}
走吧！前进吧！
冠军在等着你！
